From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:44:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: rockchip: rga: Support NV20 on the RGA3

The RGA3 reads and writes 10-bit YUV 4:2:2 with two planes in the
compact layout of NV20 (4 samples in 5 bytes), the format the Rockchip
video decoder outputs for 10-bit 4:2:2 HEVC: picture format 3 with the
compact bit set, as for NV15 with 4:2:0. Add it on both queues.

The width is aligned to 4 pixels like NV15, and as YUV 4:2:2 it can only
be flipped, not rotated by 90 or 270 degrees (TRM part 2, 5.6.3).

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/rga3-hw.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/rga3-hw.c b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/rga3-hw.c
index 77fec0d32699..fd9b10235d15 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/rga3-hw.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/rockchip/rga/rga3-hw.c
@@ -473,6 +473,11 @@ static struct rga3_fmt rga3_formats[] = {
 		.hw_format = RGA3_COLOR_FMT_YUV420_10B,
 		.yuv10b_endian = 1,
 	},
+	{
+		.fourcc = V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV20,
+		.hw_format = RGA3_COLOR_FMT_YUV422_10B,
+		.yuv10b_compact = 1,
+	},
 	{
 		.fourcc = V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV16M,
 		.hw_format = RGA3_COLOR_FMT_YUV422,
